O5: bidder simulator creatives from configuration (FAST Channels overlay on the guidance v1.4.0)

The shipped video creatives are 5, 15 and 30 s progressive 360x360 MP4s that all share adomain amazon.com, which
cannot fill a CTV pod stitched into an HLS ladder. When video_creatives.json sits beside the handler, its list
replaces the shipped one: 30.03 s HLS creatives preconditioned on the channel ladder, each with its own crid and
advertiser domain, and their burl/nurl. The handler also logs one line per request for the contract tests: the header
names it received (never their values), how many X-Forwarded-For entries arrived, and device.ip and device.ipv6 as the
request body carries them.

